  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together smoked paprika, coconut oil, lime juice, cilantro, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "3. Add chicken to the bowl and mix well to coat.",
    "4. Thread chicken onto skewers, leaving a little space between each piece.",
    "5. Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until chicken is cooked through.",
    "6. Let skewers rest for 2-3 minutes before serving."
